# Plugin host-config parity

When editing `overlay/dynamic-plugins.portal-apme.dev.yaml` or `overlay/dynamic-plugins.portal-apme.yaml`:

1. Update **both** files for the same host contract (`apiFactories`, routes, mountPoints, entityTabs, backend pluginConfig).
2. Run `make check-plugin-parity` before finishing.
3. Read root `AGENTS.md` — RHDH does not auto-register APME factories from the package alone.
